# docx-paper-template-abe — .gitignore
#
# Your manuscript lives in src/ and is meant to be committed. Everything the pipeline
# generates goes under data/ (or jank/) and is ignored here.

# --- Input-root marker (present: data/dummy/ is the input; absent: src/) ---
.development

# --- Generated files of each pipeline stage ---
data/step*/*
!data/step*/.gitkeep
data/output/*
!data/output/.gitkeep
data/products/*
!data/products/.gitkeep

# --- Production material you do not want in git (scans, raw data, ...) ---
data/source/*
!data/source/.gitkeep

# --- Filled-in submission forms (signatures and personal data; never commit) ---
# package.sh copies <INPUT_ROOT>/forms/ into the submission package for journals that set
# submission.collect_forms in profile.yaml.
src/forms/

# --- Journal templates and reference documents ---
# A journal's template (such as the society's ABETemplate.docx for the abe profile) and the
# reference.docx generated from it or from pandoc's default data are never committed: the template
# belongs to its publisher, and build.sh / diff.sh regenerate reference.docx when it is missing
# (see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md). Every Word file in a journal directory is ignored, so a downloaded
# "ABETemplate (1).docx" is not picked up by `git add -A` either. To track the reference.docx of a
# journal you add yourself, add a line such as
#   !data/journals/<id>/reference.docx
data/journals/*/*.docx
data/journals/*/*.dotx
data/journals/*/*.docm
data/journals/*/*.dotm
# Records written by make-reference.sh (source fingerprint and warnings) and their temporary files
data/journals/*/.reference.source
data/journals/*/.reference.source.*
data/journals/*/.reference.warnings
data/journals/*/.reference.stderr.*

# --- Temporary base file of make-reference.sh (left behind only if it is interrupted) ---
data/journals/*/.base-reference.docx

# --- PNG fallbacks generated from SVG figures ---
*.svg.png

# --- Mermaid output (regenerated from the .mmd source) ---
src/figs/mermaid/*.svg
src/figs/mermaid/*.pdf
data/dummy/figs/mermaid/*.svg
data/dummy/figs/mermaid/*.pdf

# --- Proprietary fonts for the svg-conversion image (licensed per user; never commit) ---
fonts/*
!fonts/.gitkeep

# --- Scratch space (diff.sh and the regression snapshots write here) ---
jank/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/

# --- Editors and OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Local settings and secrets ---
.env
.env.local
.claude/settings.local.json*
